{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XK2Tp9OkjR1794962707.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今日是亞太經合組織會議(APEC)第二日舉行工商領導人峰會，在舉行會議的前海國際會議中心外，可見大批與會嘉賓乘搭旅遊巴抵達現場。現場一帶今晨較早前開始逐步封路。稍後將舉行峰會開幕式，國家主席習近平將出席並發表主旨講話。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:43:44.150738+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T15:37:25.079173+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T01:36:53.819142+00:00","content_hash":"dc26d5acdd85a76134f5eb3f71d1386835d61640f3193eee86662cb275b4efa6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:43:44.150738+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}